(7790331, 1295942, 36065, '<td valign="top">
<b>Hey there from the Critique Club</b>
<br/>
<br/><b>My thoughts on the image:</b> This is a spectacular image that finished with a well-deserved blue ribbon.  I love that it is only your second entry back, and you are right back in the mix again.
<br/>
<br/><b>My ideas for improvement: </b> There is nothing I can offer for improvement here.  The subject is phenomenal, the composition is excellent and very eye-drawing, and the technical aspects of the capture are all spot on.  The smoke an haze play well to set an awesomely ominous tone to the photo.
<br/>
<br/><b>Where I would have/did score this entry:</b> I did vote in this one, and you were one of the three 9 scores that I gave out.  The other two finished second and third.  Congrats on an awesome photo, and welcome back to DPC competition!
<br/>
<br/>Thank you for the opportunity to provide a critique on your entry,
<br/><b>Eric</b>
<br/></td>', 'Hey there from the Critique Club

My thoughts on the image: This is a spectacular image that finished with a well-deserved blue ribbon.  I love that it is only your second entry back, and you are right back in the mix again.

My ideas for improvement:  There is nothing I can offer for improvement here.  The subject is phenomenal, the composition is excellent and very eye-drawing, and the technical aspects of the capture are all spot on.  The smoke an haze play well to set an awesomely ominous tone to the photo.

Where I would have/did score this entry: I did vote in this one, and you were one of the three 9 scores that I gave out.  The other two finished second and third.  Congrats on an awesome photo, and welcome back to DPC competition!

Thank you for the opportunity to provide a critique on your entry,
Eric', '2025-08-26 11:19:18.000000', NULL, 0),
